WEBVTT

00:08.660 --> 00:09.940
Are you all right, Rinne?

00:11.390 --> 00:13.070
I just remembered...

00:13.070 --> 00:17.140
Sid was fighting that thing 
while protecting me.

00:26.750 --> 00:27.680
Rinne!

00:32.630 --> 00:34.470
Were you the ones who did this?!

00:50.490 --> 00:53.580
But I ended up getting captured, and...

00:55.110 --> 00:57.780
I don't want to be alone again!

00:57.780 --> 00:59.450
I won't let that happen.

01:02.760 --> 01:03.960
You have me.

01:16.260 --> 01:20.810
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

02:35.050 --> 02:40.010
<b>Episode 12
"Those Who Shatter the Endless Cycle
of World Reincarnation"</b>

02:44.150 --> 02:46.680
<i>I'm sorry, Sid.</i>

02:48.140 --> 02:53.370
<i>Kai, I would have wanted to 
meet you in some other way.</i>

03:03.900 --> 03:08.040
Expanding influence on the world determined.

03:15.190 --> 03:16.220
What are you—?!

03:17.290 --> 03:19.300
You should take that as well.

03:23.340 --> 03:28.470
Removing hero of the spirits, 
Rikugen Kyoko's code from the world.

03:36.580 --> 03:38.280
What a bothersome thing.

03:47.400 --> 03:49.370
Unexpected amount 
of magical power detected.

03:49.910 --> 03:52.710
Zero Code completion in...

03:54.100 --> 03:58.210
Universal Mirroring Finale: Light.

04:15.100 --> 04:15.970
That's...!

04:15.970 --> 04:19.140
A stone statue of the hero of the celestials?!

04:20.220 --> 04:21.760
Please take command!

04:21.760 --> 04:23.110
Jeanne?!

04:25.700 --> 04:27.120
Are you okay, Kai?

04:27.660 --> 04:28.590
Rinne?

04:28.890 --> 04:32.330
I placed a barrier around us 
since it was a huge explosion.

04:33.510 --> 04:34.770
What the...?

04:34.770 --> 04:36.420
Did Rikugen Kyoko do all this?

04:36.780 --> 04:38.580
Yeah, most likely...

04:39.630 --> 04:40.580
Why?

04:41.210 --> 04:43.380
Kai! Rinne!

04:43.380 --> 04:44.310
Jeanne!

04:45.160 --> 04:46.500
You're safe?!

04:46.500 --> 04:48.180
Yeah! We're coming now!

04:49.430 --> 04:50.510
What a relief...

04:55.340 --> 04:56.980
After a blast like that, it's still...

05:11.370 --> 05:12.470
Let's go, Rinne!

05:13.690 --> 05:16.300
Continuing... deletion.

05:20.630 --> 05:21.560
Rinne!

05:21.860 --> 05:25.090
Just what is that monster?

05:36.070 --> 05:39.020
Significant impact from taboo word detected.

05:39.020 --> 05:40.520
N-No!

05:40.520 --> 05:44.370
Interference with new world 
reaching dangerous levels.

05:44.370 --> 05:45.300
N-No!

05:46.200 --> 05:48.410
Initiating deletion.

05:48.930 --> 05:50.160
No!

06:06.790 --> 06:09.260
Don't you dare touch her!

06:10.190 --> 06:14.220
Increased resistance from the wielder 
of the forbidden sword?

06:19.010 --> 06:19.940
Not yet!

06:36.930 --> 06:38.540
Begin operation!

06:40.000 --> 06:41.720
Kai! Cover Rinne!

06:45.120 --> 06:46.360
Fire!

06:56.200 --> 06:59.600
This spiritual flame arrow has absorbed 
the heat and magic that allows it

06:59.600 --> 07:00.920
to burn for eternity. 　

07:01.420 --> 07:03.900
It's the only one I managed to make.

07:03.900 --> 07:05.360
Make sure you don't miss.

07:05.360 --> 07:06.610
I understand.

07:10.980 --> 07:13.200
Pierce through!

07:59.220 --> 08:00.920
Don't let your guard down!

08:00.920 --> 08:03.460
We still don't know what may happen!

08:06.750 --> 08:10.810
Lu xemille-l-phenoria xiss.

08:11.420 --> 08:13.490
Sez cia

08:14.020 --> 08:18.880
lisyapha peln lef Es.

08:20.430 --> 08:21.680
This is...

08:22.270 --> 08:23.840
What a sad song...

08:25.150 --> 08:30.580
Eyen Es et shela alra hem

08:30.580 --> 08:33.820
meki ende bleiya.

08:41.400 --> 08:42.820
This is...

08:42.820 --> 08:44.740
World reincarnation?!

08:44.740 --> 08:46.790
All soldiers, surround the target!

08:50.750 --> 08:52.790
No, don't go!

08:52.790 --> 08:54.770
Hey, are you okay?!

08:54.770 --> 08:55.700
Falin!

09:00.120 --> 09:03.850
Commence world reincarnation 
second level shift.

09:20.520 --> 09:22.240
Authorization granted.

09:22.950 --> 09:26.210
Utilize higher-level ability 
to perform "Alternate Code."

09:27.870 --> 09:31.850
Commence overwrite of "Strongest Hero."

09:55.720 --> 09:57.050
Sid.

10:00.490 --> 10:01.990
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

10:03.490 --> 10:05.000
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?

10:09.600 --> 10:14.840
Sid, your mistake has disrupted our fate.

10:15.960 --> 10:17.910
But I won't give up.

10:19.240 --> 10:21.760
Even if everything in this world 
falls to pieces...

10:22.530 --> 10:25.360
I'll make sure the mythical beasts are saved.

10:36.830 --> 10:40.320
Commence recording as Prophet Sid.

10:41.750 --> 10:43.530
Stop messing around, Last Riser!

10:47.670 --> 10:50.000
You're just copying his appearance.

10:50.350 --> 10:52.140
You have no right to use that name!

10:56.380 --> 10:58.220
I hate you, too!

11:01.900 --> 11:04.000
Don't make fun of Sid!

11:05.010 --> 11:08.020
Capture the final entity, Rinne.

11:09.980 --> 11:11.000
Kai!

11:15.870 --> 11:18.150
Give her back!

11:36.750 --> 11:37.920
<i>Am I...</i>

11:48.950 --> 11:51.230
Why do you train so much?

11:51.960 --> 11:53.870
Because it's my duty.

11:54.770 --> 11:57.150
Are you planning on becoming Sid, the Hero?

11:57.720 --> 11:58.920
No, that's not it.

11:59.390 --> 12:00.880
To me, Sid is...

12:04.010 --> 12:05.840
Sid is who I...

12:08.850 --> 12:10.080
Sid is...

12:16.180 --> 12:18.220
You're not Sid!

12:21.710 --> 12:23.300
Sid wanted to...

12:25.050 --> 12:27.010
save Rinne!

12:37.710 --> 12:38.690
Huh?

12:48.870 --> 12:50.140
<i>You, mixed being.</i>

12:50.140 --> 12:51.800
<i>You're not a part of any race.</i>

12:51.800 --> 12:53.720
<i>Why were you even born?</i>

12:53.720 --> 12:55.230
<i>What a chaotic smell.</i>

12:55.230 --> 12:56.680
<i>Get out of the way, you mongrel!</i>

12:56.680 --> 12:58.340
<i>You and your filthy life...</i>

12:58.340 --> 13:00.050
<i>There's no place for you.</i>

13:00.670 --> 13:02.590
<i>You poor child.</i>

13:02.940 --> 13:03.920
You're wrong!

13:05.080 --> 13:06.870
I hated everyone,

13:07.430 --> 13:09.890
but now I like them a little bit...

13:10.400 --> 13:13.370
All... because Kai will stay with me...

13:15.130 --> 13:18.060
That's why I can keep going!

13:18.950 --> 13:22.960
I'm not... a poor child!

13:36.960 --> 13:37.890
Kai!

13:43.620 --> 13:45.600
Rinne, are you all right?

13:45.600 --> 13:48.440
Yeah! I'm going to fight with you, Kai!

13:51.900 --> 13:55.900
What you copied was only Sid's powers!

14:01.520 --> 14:04.190
The one who inherited Sid's will...

14:05.860 --> 14:06.950
was me!

14:32.510 --> 14:33.440
Kai!

14:34.180 --> 14:35.430
Take it!

14:47.790 --> 14:48.900
This is...

14:50.420 --> 14:52.840
Fate will not change.

14:53.930 --> 14:56.990
World reincarnation will continue to cycle.

14:57.980 --> 14:59.850
This isn't fate!

15:02.270 --> 15:04.310
What changes the world

15:05.740 --> 15:09.020
has always been someone's resolve!

15:16.860 --> 15:19.180
Disabled... Sid...

15:19.800 --> 15:21.840
World... the race's...

15:39.730 --> 15:41.400
Is the world reincarnation...?

15:48.750 --> 15:49.840
Rinne!

16:27.380 --> 16:28.310
Huh?

16:33.280 --> 16:34.880
Help me.

16:50.590 --> 16:51.650
Rinne?

16:51.650 --> 16:52.580
Kai?!

16:55.660 --> 16:56.870
H-Hey, Rinne?!

16:57.250 --> 17:02.270
I'm so glad... I was scared you 
weren't going to ever wake up...

17:03.620 --> 17:05.750
Seems I worried you.

17:07.630 --> 17:12.040
Kai, do you know how I feel about you?

17:12.040 --> 17:12.970
What?

17:13.290 --> 17:17.800
At first, I was just happy being with you.

17:18.430 --> 17:23.080
I tolerated humans because 
I wanted to be with you,

17:23.080 --> 17:26.520
and I was able to keep fighting 
because you were by my side.

17:28.570 --> 17:31.880
But now, I don't want to just be with you.

17:31.880 --> 17:32.810
What?

17:34.370 --> 17:39.340
I want you to... like me, Kai.

17:41.190 --> 17:45.980
What do you think of me?

17:46.630 --> 17:47.860
Well...

17:51.100 --> 17:52.800
Rinne, how's Kai...

17:56.200 --> 17:57.130
Oh...

17:57.680 --> 18:00.390
You shouldn't be doing stuff like that!

17:58.070 --> 18:00.390
What do you think you guys are doing?!

18:00.390 --> 18:02.930
Oh! Why did you have to come now?!

18:02.930 --> 18:05.650
Are you okay? You were asleep for three days.

18:05.650 --> 18:06.430
Three days?!

18:06.430 --> 18:11.260
After you defeated Last Riser, 
you suddenly lost consciousness.

18:11.260 --> 18:14.610
We immediately brought you here 
to the Yulun Rebel Army's hospital.

18:15.090 --> 18:18.780
Rinne woke up within a few hours, 
but, Kai, you were...

18:20.470 --> 18:22.170
I... see.

18:22.580 --> 18:25.340
Regardless, I'm glad you woke up.

18:25.340 --> 18:26.560
You said it.

18:27.740 --> 18:29.670
By the way... Rinne.

18:30.010 --> 18:33.300
It's very unfair of you to take advantage 
of Kai as soon as he wakes up.

18:33.300 --> 18:36.080
Y-Yeah, it's unfair! I trusted you!

18:36.080 --> 18:37.630
I-It's fair!

18:38.010 --> 18:41.520
You were holding Kai's hand for 
a long time last night, too, Jeannie!

18:41.520 --> 18:42.700
You were watching?!

18:42.700 --> 18:46.120
Reiren didn't leave Kai's side at all either!

18:46.120 --> 18:50.830
Th-That was only to give him treatment, 
and I wasn't doing anything...

18:51.450 --> 18:52.830
What are they talking about?

19:17.930 --> 19:20.630
I didn't expect you to be all right.

19:20.630 --> 19:23.750
Yeah, especially after that explosion...

19:25.090 --> 19:26.720
Rikugen Kyoko.

19:26.720 --> 19:28.290
I'm not all right.

19:28.290 --> 19:30.830
This is only because I'd split my core.

19:30.830 --> 19:35.860
Unless I absorb a large amount of spirits 
or an enormous amount of magic,

19:35.860 --> 19:39.030
it'll take me 30 years 
to completely recover.

19:39.770 --> 19:41.280
You monster.

19:41.910 --> 19:45.890
Make sure you keep the truce 
agreement with the humans.

19:45.890 --> 19:47.290
You're annoying.

19:47.290 --> 19:52.690
If you think we broke our promise, 
you can just smash weak, little ol' Kyoko.

19:52.690 --> 19:55.290
Weak? Look who's talking...

19:55.290 --> 19:57.660
Listen up, human! Spirit!

19:58.180 --> 20:00.290
If you damage this stone statue,

20:00.290 --> 20:03.220
you will be making an enemy of 
the entire celestial race!

20:03.560 --> 20:04.910
Of course.

20:04.910 --> 20:08.830
We'll make this place 
off-limits to all races.

20:08.830 --> 20:10.400
Kyoko also agrees.

20:10.810 --> 20:15.190
Right now, we must take priority in finding 
out more about Last Riser and defeating it.

20:15.540 --> 20:18.580
And the lead we have is 
with the remaining hero, huh?

20:18.580 --> 20:19.530
Yeah...

20:20.270 --> 20:24.600
The hero of the mythical beasts, 
the Fang King Rath=IE.

20:29.990 --> 20:34.680
<i>The shift to the second level of 
world reincarnation has failed.</i>

20:35.460 --> 20:39.260
<i>This was expected, since only one 
Last Riser's power was used for it...</i>

20:41.490 --> 20:45.710
<i>Besides that... 
that child is continuing to awaken.</i>

20:49.830 --> 20:52.670
<i>And the one who set it off was...</i>

20:54.100 --> 20:55.080
All right!

20:55.080 --> 20:55.940
Is there some over there?

20:55.940 --> 20:56.870
Yes!

20:57.420 --> 20:58.060
Here you go.

20:58.060 --> 20:58.990
Whoa!

20:59.400 --> 21:00.420
Right?

21:06.650 --> 21:07.740
Kai.

21:08.170 --> 21:10.680
Do you think that the statue 
of the celestial hero is...

21:11.230 --> 21:12.990
the same as that?

21:13.710 --> 21:15.120
Yeah, could be.

21:16.280 --> 21:19.340
<i>World reincarnation will continue to cycle.</i>

21:23.630 --> 21:27.130
<i>Yet still, Rinne, Kai...</i>

21:27.750 --> 21:32.330
<i>How can you continue to resist fate?</i>

21:39.410 --> 21:42.630
Honestly, I'm not sure either.

21:43.100 --> 21:46.620
It's just that... Sid entrusted me with this.

21:46.620 --> 21:47.490
What?

21:48.360 --> 21:52.700
To protect you and end 
the Great War of the Five Races.

21:53.490 --> 21:54.710
Kai!

21:57.890 --> 21:58.850
Let's go.

21:58.850 --> 21:59.780
Yeah!

23:37.180 --> 23:40.020
Why Does Nobody

Remember Me in This World?
